414 PM PDT Wed Jul 30 2025



...Blowing dust moving across portions of northwest Nye county

this afternoon...



An area of blowing dust from thunderstorms will be moving across

northwest Nye county this afternoon. Satellite imagery is showing

this dust moving to the east at about 20 mph and will be

affecting State Route 376, including the towns of Round Mountain

and Manhattan. The blowing dust will be accompanied by winds of 20

to 30 mph along with reductions of two miles or less in dust.

Motorists driving along State Route 376 are encouraged to use

caution as rapid reductions to visibility are possible. Please

slow down and use low beams if possible.



Visit www.weather.gov/elko for the latest weather information.



